{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "story_durnar_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_durnar_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "额外训练",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_durnar_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "0dbb17682ca77061cc1de7f0e44bf82c5a4c0f25dfa0c59d6ea298a8d376d99e",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "坚雷对A1小队的战斗测试"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "辛苦了，A1预备小队的新人们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "今天的例行训练内容，到这里就——结束了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "恭喜恭喜！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "哎呀，原本你们刚来的时候练个把小时就要死要活的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "看看现在，一个个还都还没喘。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "说明训练效果还不错。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格鲁",
      "text": "嘿嘿，谢谢教官。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "米格鲁！坚雷教官发言还没结束，你怎么可以——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "好啦芬，我又不是杜宾，没那么多规矩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "大家平时训练都很累了，这种时候就轻松一点，可以吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "是！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "你啊，越来越像杜宾了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "是！——是吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "你看啊，腰板一挺，手往两旁一贴，视线直勾勾对着我眼睛，这不就是杜宾嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "语调么，这个就不用我说了吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "真的哦，一模一样~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "不过这也是件好事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "和我当兵那会不一样，罗德岛有个完整的教官团负责所有预备干员的培训，每个人都有他们的特点。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "我想不到的，他们就会察觉到并给你们补上一课，反之也一样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "这样一来，每个预备干员都能获得接近全面的训练课程，而不是让个傻大兵来想所有事情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "格瑞斯、法伦、杜宾，还有其他人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "无论是处理教学课程还是一起上战场，都是些值得信任的好伙计啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "芬。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "是！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "加油把杜宾身上的东西都学过来好吗，我们还挺想多一个助教的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "好的教官，谢谢教官关心！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "还有，提醒我训练完以后找管理场地的人修整场地。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "好几次都练忘了，结果回头就被杜宾骂，唉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "明白了吗，芬，一定要提醒我啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "是，教官！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "好，谢谢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "闲聊就到此为止了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "全体都有——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "立——正！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "正如大家所知的那样，今天的例行训练内容结束了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "但我们的训练时间还空出了不少。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "所以，在接下来的时间里，我将和大家一起进行愉快的对抗训练！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "（倒吸一口凉气）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格鲁",
      "text": "唉？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "鉴于有几位朋友还没参与过对抗训练的课程，所以呢，我会简单讲一下训练内容。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格鲁",
      "text": "（完了，死定了！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "虽然听上去挺花哨，但其实就是模拟实战训练，我会评估大家的作战方式，然后给出优化方案。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "（小声）姐姐，你看看米格鲁啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "（小声）别说话，先听教官讲完。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "啊当然，这次和普通的对抗还是有区别的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "嗯——既然你们都在，那就当一对五的训练赛吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "正好也让我检查一下各位的训练成果和默契程度。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "好，大家先休息一会，放放松，吃块糖什么的，我也去做个准备。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "解散！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格鲁",
      "text": "芬！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格鲁",
      "text": "怎么办！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "我，我不知道啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "你们太紧张啦，又不是杜宾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格鲁",
      "text": "坚雷教官是不可怕啊，但，但格斗对抗训练时候的她完全是另外一回事啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "怎么回事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格鲁",
      "text": "坚雷教官会参加近卫、重装和先锋干员的近身对抗练习，这炎熔你是知道的吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "是啊，然后嘞？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格鲁",
      "text": "你知道那时候坚雷教官是怎么样的吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "还能......怎么样？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格鲁",
      "text": "她会放下盾牌提着两把剑暴锤我一个小时的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格鲁",
      "text": "唰唰唰像风一样！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "啊，是这样......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "我以前一直以为教官天天都很和善，不怎么批评人，还会请大家吃好吃的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "第一次格斗对抗训练结束以后才知道......坚雷教官要是开骂了比杜宾教官还狠。几轮打下来，枪都有点拿不稳。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "特别是持盾的那只手，一旦拿了剑，挥下来真的像闪电那么快。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "啊，我知道了，大概就是和流星姐姐在训练场里对射那种感觉吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "呜哇，和流星......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "你可真行啊克洛丝。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "嘿嘿，没过一分钟就中了五支训练箭啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "好菜......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "嘿嘿。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "总之，如果不想挨打，千万，千万不可以小瞧坚雷教官啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "她可是个老兵，要不是对哥伦比亚军方有意见，现在还是在役士兵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "如果她一会多带把刀来，我们就——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "芙蓉，我问问啊，今天早上有人因为外伤去医疗部擦药水的吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "每天来医疗部的人都特别多，擦伤淤青之类其实还，挺常见的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "芙蓉，这个很重要，帮忙想一想。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "今天早上我在给病房里的人换药，没有去坐诊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "但是听苏苏洛说。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格鲁",
      "text": "说什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "好像A4预备小队所有人早上训练结束后都去了一下外科。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "嗯，是坚雷教官带着去的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "这有什么联系吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格鲁",
      "text": "有！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "没想到玫兰莎和卡缇也没能挡住教官......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "就算教官能一个人对付你们，但我们有五个人啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "A4也有五个人......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "那、那有什么，我们还是比A4要强的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "对吧，芬。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "啊，啊啊，是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "我们加油......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格鲁",
      "text": "加油！加油......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "你们好像没什么信心嘛，真有这么可怕？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "全体都有——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格鲁",
      "text": "来了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "列队！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "众人",
      "text": "是！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "嗯，看来你们都准备好了，很不错。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "教官，能问个问题吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "（克洛丝！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "问吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "您为什么，多带了把训练剑啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "看你这问题问的，当然是为了训练。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "哎呀，刚刚休息的时候突然怀念起以前的战斗技巧，想找人试试。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "啊当然，我和大家用的东西一样，是训练用装备，没带自己改装的电刃。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "你们最好重视点啊，别因为平时对你们和善就觉得实践也会让你们一手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "不想挨打，就好好应战。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "训练手册上对于突发应敌的步骤之前有看过吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "众人",
      "text": "有！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "那就好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "第一次对抗我会面对你们开始，之后就要把整个场地利用起来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "愣着干什么，碰到敌人不需要警戒吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "啊是！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "警戒！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "好，反应不错。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "既然是初战，就由你们先发起攻击吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "互相之间要注意配合，要是不当心，那就和我挨个对付你们没区别了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "明白了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "众人",
      "text": "明白！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "那就开始吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "米格鲁，盯紧了啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格鲁",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "炎熔、克洛丝，准备......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "好~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "不用你说。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "芙蓉，治疗就交给你了，米格鲁压力会比较大，优先照顾她。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "我明白了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "准备——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "放！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "慢了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格鲁",
      "text": "呜啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "糟糕！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "哼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "米格鲁，把教官逼回去！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格鲁",
      "text": "在做了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "大家盯紧些。只要教官不出我们视线她没机会的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "吃我这招！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格鲁",
      "text": "哎呀！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "怎——？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "啊糟糕！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "哼！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格鲁",
      "text": "啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "炎熔你怎么回事！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "完了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "喝啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "唔！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "唉？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "啊呜......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "我瞄到了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "啊呜......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "教官？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "咕......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "呼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "都起来吧，我来整理一下问题。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "众人",
      "text": "是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "炎熔，我们本来有机会的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "不好意思啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "但我怎么知道米格鲁会突然挡住我嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "这就是问题，对吗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "是，是的教官！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "（好凶！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "确实，现在地形上没有高低起伏，后排更容易产生误伤。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "而且炎熔的源石技艺特性在这样的空间里施展不开。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "是，是这样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "在这种情况下，你完全可以把技艺施展到我背后，压缩我的活动空间。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "啊——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "在我和你的队友几乎面对面的情况下。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "为什么瞄准我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "呜......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "米格鲁。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格鲁",
      "text": "在！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格鲁",
      "text": "（要挨骂了......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "“那个问题”，还没能克服。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格鲁",
      "text": "是的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "唉......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "比以前稳了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "但是，还不够。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "卡缇防御的时候特别喜欢晃动，虽然这样会产生更多破绽，但这招对她是不管用的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "我知道你的作战风格是求稳，但在还没能稳到抵抗干扰的时候，就要用技巧去补足。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "过来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格鲁",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "举盾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格鲁",
      "text": "举盾！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "还记得我刚刚是怎么干扰你的吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格鲁",
      "text": "您格挡我的攻击，然后撞在盾上，我就被带到炎熔的源石技艺运行轨迹上去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "如果芬的行动够快，她完全可以在我撞上你之前把我逼退。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "就像第一次克洛丝做的那样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "抱歉......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "但如果你准备一个人接下我的撞击，你可以试试三种解决方式。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "一，想好反击手段，然后闪开。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "这会让你的队友在某个瞬间完全暴露在敌人面前，但只要你能伺机击倒我，就可以快速回到防御姿态。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "二，直接架盾冲撞。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "盾也是一种武器，在面对冲撞时，你也可以通过盾牌展开进攻。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "只是，你需要时刻注意对方，别人没撞到，自己一个踉跄冲出去，把后背和队友留给敌人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "三，偏转方向。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "你之所以会被我撞到炎熔的法术前，完全是因为你的姿态和重心让我有这样的机会。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "如果你的防御姿势是这样的话......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "喝！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格鲁",
      "text": "啊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格鲁",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格鲁",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "对不对？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "还是后退了，但没有影响到炎熔和克洛丝的攻击路径。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格鲁",
      "text": "嗯！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "那就好，先学会这套方法。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格鲁",
      "text": "好的教官。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "芬。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "在！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "你是小队的队长，负责指挥大家。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "是的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "告诉我，你怎么确认队友情况？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "靠感觉和观察。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "观察？怎么观察。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "用，用眼睛看......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "在你回头瞥一眼的瞬间，你觉得敌人会不会抓住这个机会。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "会......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "你们小队的站位是根据基础课程教材来的吗。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "是的教官。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "但，不是太严格。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "战场条件那么复杂，严格执行才会出错。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "这样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "芙蓉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "在，教官！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "你需要承担芬的部分职责，可以吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "啊，好的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "但我具体要做些什么呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "你需要成为芬背后的眼睛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "如果你、炎熔和克洛丝的站位发生较大改变，需要告知芬。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "周边环境的变化，特别是后方变动，你需要立刻告诉她。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "在芬倒下的时候，你需要负责领导队伍。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "可以吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "好的教官，我试试看！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "克洛丝。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "我错了~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "我不该射芙蓉的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "远程干员的专业和分工我不太懂，就不评价了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "单论团队配合，你做得还不错。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "谢谢~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "你方便说一下自己在射击对抗训练上的表现吗，我好做个预估。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克洛丝",
      "text": "一般是流星姐姐来当老师，唰唰唰就把我射倒了~",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "克洛斯，别太随便了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "流星——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "好，好，我知道了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "好了，都给我打起精神来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "这才过了几分钟啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "接下来我们要用上训练场的障碍物了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "这里就是战场，而战场上的敌人可不会对你们手下留情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "希望你们，或者我，能在这里多活几秒。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "互相加油吧，小朋友们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一小时后"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "哈......哈......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "哎呀，看来我没怎么退步，真是太好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "嗯——时间正好，那我们今天的训练就正式结束了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "恭喜恭喜！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "怎么不拍手了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格鲁",
      "text": "对......对不起教官......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "好啦，一会请你们吃好吃的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "腊肠怎么样？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "我那儿刚刚到了些炎国的腊肠，用特质酱料腌过，又鲜又香，可诱人了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "炎熔",
      "text": "啊，听上去就很好吃！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蓉",
      "text": "会不会太油腻了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "但在那之前，我得带你们先去一趟医疗部。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "你们放心，我也安心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米格鲁",
      "text": "原来卡缇她们不是被教官打进医疗部的啊，吓死我了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "那当然不是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "当了那么多年兵，别的不说，对付你们几个还是有法子的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "轻重缓急，早就拿捏好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "但是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "交给你们的技巧，可都是实打实拿伤口和战友的命换回来的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "要是给我发现你们哪个不好好把诀窍记脑子里，下一次我就拿电刃和你们练。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "明白了吗！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "众人",
      "text": "明，明白！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "好，那就出发吧，早检查完早吃东西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "众人",
      "text": "好！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "（我好像忘了件事......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "（教官要我做什么来着？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "芬，酸辣的吃嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "吃，吃啊？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "那一会的零食啊——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "好，谢谢教官！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坚雷",
      "text": "都下课了，还在喊教官呐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芬",
      "text": "不好意思，坚雷小姐......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "text": "你来的正好，训练场是你在管理吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "后勤干员",
      "text": "是，是的，杜宾教官，怎么了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "text": "坚雷带的小组使用完训练场地以后一些设施和障碍物有损毁，估计是刚刚进行了高强度对抗训练。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "text": "请帮我修整一下，晚上我带预备干员要用。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "后勤干员",
      "text": "好，我这就去办。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "text": "多谢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
